What changed: @ledgerforce/ap gains read models (bills-read.ts: billCodingOptions, listBills,
getBillDetail, billJournalView) and previewBillJournal, which runs the engine preview on the
same journal builder approveBill posts (billJournal extracted from approveBill, behaviour
unchanged). API: GET /ap/bills (all bills; ?queue=awaiting_approval unchanged), GET
/ap/bills/:id (coding, people involved, caller's SoD outlook for approval via new read-only
sodOutlook), GET /ap/bills/:id/journal (preview for a draft, posted entry after approval),
all ap.read; GET /ap/bill-coding (suppliers, expense/asset accounts, tax codes) ap.bill.enter.

Why: SS-UC05-08 needs screens that code, approve and show the posted journal; the API had
only enter/submit/approve and the approval queue (DL-0440).

Validation: apps/api/src/ap/bills-read.db.test.ts RED first (4 failing: 404/400, saved to
.agent/evidence/T-0086/red-api-bills-read.txt), now green with bills.db.test.ts (7 tests);
packages/modules/ap db tests 39/39 (GP-008 unchanged); api-unit 103/103; eslint + prettier
clean on touched files. Full typecheck not run yet.

Next action: Playwright spec tests/e2e/web/bills.spec.ts RED, then the purchases screens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
